 true, while statement III is false. Notice the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{Δ}_{1} & ={a}_{11}=8>0 \\\\ {Δ}_{2} & =|\\begin{aligned}8 & -3 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}|=7>0 \\\\ {Δ}_{3} & =|A|=21>0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, by Sylvester's criterion, the form ${x}^{T}\\,A\\,x,$ and the matrix $A,$ are positive-definite.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378692 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378693 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378694 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378695 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1000 #edb/ref 17592186378696 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1041 "selection" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1104 #edb/ref 17592186378696 13194139535995 true] [17592186378691 1110 #uuid "efb3bf05-aba7-59b1-b3a6-5cc3dcd01712" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378692 1034 "I and III only" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378692 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535995 true] [17592186378692 1111 #uuid "f1a37e1d-d602-5642-bebc-5e8ce43ee619" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378693 1034 "I only" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378693 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535995 true] [17592186378693 1111 #uuid "ccd5acb5-d3ec-52ca-a480-88e44d77cc1b" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378694 1034 "III only" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378694 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535995 true] [17592186378694 1111 #uuid "113aa503-1dc5-5630-a51c-3f2b5cc25f80" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378695 1034 "I and II only" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378695 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535995 true] [17592186378695 1111 #uuid "78d5cbf4-84b1-5159-baf8-776cdb79bc15" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378696 1034 "II only" 13194139535995 true] [17592186378696 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535995 true] [17592186378696 1111 #uuid "f53d3e81-f14c-5cd6-bac0